      "id": 234344,
      "name": "Godai",
      "username": "Godai",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/{size}/1920_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-12-10T15:16:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Copy+pasting from the pdf, a section called The Process, in relation to making villains. This does not give examples or concrete numbers, just an idea of what you're going to do, in order.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>• Come up with a concept<br>\n• Choose a villain’s approach on pages 208-219:<br>\na villain’s core stats, plus how they enact their<br>\nvillainous goals when confronting the heroes<br>\n• Assign powers using the list on page 47<br>\n• Assign qualities using the list on page 47<br>\n• Assign abilities from their approach<br>\n• Choose a villain’s archetype on pages 220-234:<br>\nthe general method of how they operate as a villain, what drives them, and what they care about in an action scene<br>\n• Gain status dice from their archetype<br>\n• Assignabilitiesfromtheirarchetype<br>\n• Add upgrades on pages 235-238 (optional)<br>\n• Add a villainous mastery on page 238 (optional) • Determine Health total on page 239 by adding<br>\nup the values from their approach, archetype,<br>\nⒽ times 5, and any upgrades • Add finishing touches</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:24.911Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 4,
      "reads": 6,
      "readers_count": 5,
      "score": 21.2,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 20418,
      "topic_slug": "villain-creation-example",
      "display_username": "Godai",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
